{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：人物心理变化的因果交代和前后承接不如X完整，尤其S05到S06，从争得疲惫到允许自己怀念的转折，Y更多依靠感受词暗示，X则说得更清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边看的普通观众，我更容易通过Y加亮的关键词迅速抓住人物此刻在想什么，短句也让每段的核心矛盾比较醒目。感受词随音乐出现，加上具体的声音、动作和身体反应，让音乐与人物情绪之间的联系更细腻，不只是给情绪贴标签。不过X的叙述在心理因果和前后转折上更完整，尤其能解释人物为什么一边怀念、一边抗拒，最后又怎样逐渐作出选择。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，但它并没有全面胜过X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d2090c8b-a22e-46ed-9c10-b468adbcb498", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T181033335175Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.907, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:11:58.247019+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e4ee7505ff444225370f732db0a8b861a59e27c15a7b0f51abd8f270ffeab696", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool